# Bot1 casts Copy Artifact (Mox Sapphire pays {U}, an Island {1}) and has it enter as a copy of Bot2's Ornithopter,
# one of two artifacts on offer (Bot1's own Mox is the other; Copy Artifact itself is not: the choice is made before
# it enters, CR 614.12a). It is not blue any more (the card's ruling) and is an enchantment in addition to the artifact
# creature types (CR 707.9b). Ornithopter is untouched; the unchosen Mox stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Copy Artifact
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Copy Artifact.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Types = Artifact; Creature; Enchantment
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Colors = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Types = Artifact; Creature
